function #pragma doc Creates an offset depending on the input sign. 
         The output is equal to (input*slope)+ offset if the input is strictly positive, 
         otherwise the output is equal to ( input * slope) - offset.  #end PreLoadSymmetrical (PLS_Input: 'T;
                                                                                               Offset: 'T;
                                                                                               Slope: 'T;)
  returns (PLS_Output: 'T;)
  where 'T numeric
