inline function #pragma doc Creates offset value depending on the input sign. 
                The output is equal to (input*Slope)+PosOffset if the input is positive or zero, 
                otherwise equal to (input*Slope)+NegOffset if the input is negative.  #end PreLoadUnSymmetrical (PLUS_Input: 'T;
                                                                                                                 NegOffset: 'T;
                                                                                                                 PosOffset: 'T;
                                                                                                                 Slope: 'T;)
